>This is a kind reminder to submit your <strong>Performance Planning and Appraisal (PPA)</strong> form for the period <strong>January-2025-to-December-2025</strong>.</p>\n\n      <p>The extended deadline for submission is <strong>April 15, 2025</strong>. Kindly ensure that your PPA is completed and submitted before this date.</p>\n\n      <p>You can access the PPA form by logging into the staff portal:</p>\n\n      <p>\n        <a href=\"https://tools.africacdc.org/staff/performance\" class=\"btn\">Submit My PPA</a>\n      </p>\n\n      <p>If you have already submitted your PPA, kindly ignore this reminder.</p>\n\n      <p>Thank you for your attention and commitment.</p>\n\n      <p>Best regards,<br>\n      <strong>Human Resources</strong></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      &copy; 2025 Africa CDC. All rights reserved.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n', 0, '2025-04-19', '2025-04-19 23:13:30', '2025-04-19 00:00:00', 'Staff Portal System');
