ong>January 2025 to December 2025</strong>.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          Your PPA has been forwarded to your supervisor for review. You will be notified once any actions are taken on your submission.\n        </p>\n\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/staff/performance/view_ppa/007837fdc355524026fee5e204c6e21d/558\" class=\"btn\" style=\"color:#fff !important;\">View Submitted PPA</a>\n\n\n        <p>\n          Best regards,<br>\n          <strong>HR Team, Africa CDC</strong>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Footer -->\n      <div class=\"footer\">\n        &copy; 2025 Africa CDC. All rights reserved.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n', 0, '2025-04-20', '2025-04-20 01:24:58', '2025-04-20 01:24:58', 'Mr Andrew Agaba'),
