(27, 21, 'A digitally literate workforce capable of effectively utilizing digital solutions in public health initiatives, research, and emergency response.', 'Implement Process Improvement Initiatives to Reduce Operational Cost and sustain a Culture of Excellence', 'Number of training partnerships established with accredited institutions.', '2', 'Partner with accredited external training institutions to ensure high-quality instruction and certifications in relevant ICT fields.', '2025', 0, '2025-04-05 10:53:12'),
