(39, 21, 'Modernize and Enhance ICT Infrastructure', 'Support the establishment of RCCs', 'Number of RCCs with backup internet and communication infrastructure.', '1', 'Pay DIA connection deskphone, dongles from EthioTele, and  AirFiber and donlge from Safaricom for Secreatriat', '2025', 0, '2025-04-05 10:53:12'),
