(66, 21, 'innovative and adoptable digital health solutions to enhance healthcare delivery and system efficiency. ', 'Promote innovation and the adoption of digital health solutions to enhance healthcare delivery and system efficiency.', 'Percentage of Member States adopting local digital health innovations', '20', 'Promote innovation and the adoption of digital health solutions to enhance healthcare delivery and system efficiency.', '2025', 1, '2025-05-03 08:56:20'),
